{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達行政總裁黃仁勳近期陷入一系列涉及個人關係、國家安全和公司晶片出口的爭議，相關報道在全球媒體迅速擴散。一項針對近期新聞報道的分析顯示，在統計的1641篇相關報道中，約75%呈現負面傾向。研究還認為，《紐約時報》在整個報道傳播過程中扮演了重要的源頭角色，其連續發佈的報道被其他媒體大量引用和轉載。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586788.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T12:13:42.581192+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T11:58:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T12:06:55.348594+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T12:06:55.348594+00:00","content_hash":"a896eb8dca953b965d2a95414ae95c3b0d5af065d5da0cedca57c86551984b77","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}